<title>AUSTRALIA: Westpac Banking Corp announces securitisation.</title>
<headline>Westpac Banking Corp announces securitisation.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Westpac Banking Corp has announced a A$695 million four tranche securitisation of mortage-backed securities on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The issue was the fourth in the bank's ongoing home loan securisation programme, and the second from the Westpac Securitisation Trust programme.</p>
